  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate resilient urban development by planting a forest belt in the city of Razzakov in order to increase sequestration</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">D&#xfc;rreresistente B&#xe4;ume pflanzen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">In der Stadt Razzakov sollen insgesamt 1000 d&#xfc;rreresistente B&#xe4;ume gepflanzt werden, die die BewohnerInnen vor Hitze im Sommer sch&#xfc;tzen und die Stadt attraktiver machen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal pursued by this project is to increase sequestration and comply with the implementation of the green city an increase resilience to climate change. To achive these goals, the project will implement activities organazied around interdependent components.
Component 1: Development of a norm for ensuring oasis greenery for the town of Razzakov
Component 2: Planting green spaces in the manned park and streets of the city of Razzakov</narrative>
  </description>
